# ============================================
# SOTTO MOBILE — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ============================================
#
# DO NOT edit this file manually.
# All EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are managed in Doppler (project: sotto).
#
# To generate .env from Doppler:
#   npm run mobile:env
#
# This runs automatically when you start the app:
#   npm run mobile:ios
#   npm run mobile:android
#
# The LAN_IP placeholder in EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL is replaced
# automatically with your machine's en0 IP address.
# ============================================
